  "foot": {
    "text": "Software-controlled re-arm example. A command arms the channel; accepted triggers consume armed state, wait 2 timer ticks, and generate a 3-tick pulse. Triggers while busy are ignored. After completion, software must re-arm before another trigger is accepted."
